Package: ccr
Title: Claude Code R - Set Up Repositories for Claude Code Web
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Felix", "Lorenz", email = "felixlorenz18@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A lightweight helper that scaffolds a new R project ready for use
    with Claude Code Web. It creates a project skeleton with dedicated
    directories for anonymised and real data, drops in template CLAUDE.md
    files, initialises git and pushes the repository to GitHub. It also
    ships helpers to anonymise real datasets (row shuffling and type aware
    column replacement) into a shareable form.
